#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Reconciling your account assures, that your recordings match those of "
#| "your institution and that there are no mistakes on either side. You "
#| "should reconcile your account whenever you receive a statement from your "
#| "institution.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "All relevant information necessary for this process is usually printed on "
#| "your statement.\n"
